{"id":"soborno","lemma":"soborno","pos":"noun","rank":4541,"glosses":["bribery","bribe","subornation"],"ipa":"/soˈboɾno/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"sobornos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-soborno.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Aceptaste o no el soborno?","en":"Did you or did you not accept the bribe?","words":[{"g":"to accept","l":"aceptar"},{"g":"or"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"La policía no debería aceptar sobornos.","en":"Police shouldn't take bribes.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"Civility"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to accept"},null]},{"text":"Ella esperaba que él aceptase el soborno.","en":"She expected him to take the bribe.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608785","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to hope","l":"esperar"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"he"},null,{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Tom ha sido acusado de soborno.","en":"Tom has been accused of bribery.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/300832","words":[null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"accused"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Él se negó a aceptar el soborno.","en":"He refused to take the bribe.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642192","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to deny","l":"negar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to accept"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}